OL,3,APretending to be in New Zeland, booking
OL,4,Aleave and buying consoles - the lengths
OL,5,Afans are going to for GTA 6
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto fans have waited 13
OL,8,Flong years for the latest edition of
OL,9,Fthe game to be released - and going to
OL,10,Fextreme lengths to be ready for its
OL,11,Flaunch.
OL,13,FGTA 6 will be released at midnight on
OL,14,FWednesday - and Victoria Evans, from
OL,15,FWest Sussex, is not leaving anything to
OL,16,Fchance.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
