OL,3,APretending to be in New Zeland, booking
OL,4,Aleave and buying consoles - the lengths
OL,5,Afans are going to for GTA 6
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe has her alarm set for 0500, and has
OL,8,Fa day off booked. She says she put the
OL,9,Fgame's release on her leave request
OL,10,Fform which was approved, she told BBC
OL,11,FNews, despite the fact her boss
OL,12,F"doesn't know what GTA 6 is".
OL,14,FShe's far from the only one. For the
OL,15,Fgame's launch day, HR software company
OL,16,FBrightHR looked at absence data from
OL,17,Fmore than 1.2 million employees from
OL,18,F70,000 businesses across the UK.
